(7392534, 1162453, 15511, '<td valign="top">Richard and Lucy had gone for the day...<br/> <br/>ETA: <br/> <br/>My first impression of this image reminded me of my daughter''s favorite childhood story book - <u><i>There and Back Again</i></u>; we read it together so many times that the covers came off and she could read it back by the time she was 4 or 5. It''s a story of a child''s toy bunny and his adventure. The reference is the second sentence in the tale. I bought another copy to read to her son.<br/> <br/>Good times!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-08-03 02:38:03.</i></td>', 'Richard and Lucy had gone for the day... ETA:  My first impression of this image reminded me of my daughter''s favorite childhood story book - There and Back Again; we read it together so many times that the covers came off and she could read it back by the time she was 4 or 5. It''s a story of a child''s toy bunny and his adventure. The reference is the second sentence in the tale. I bought another copy to read to her son. Good times!', '2015-07-27 01:56:16.000000', '2015-08-03 03:38:03.000000', 1),
