(7392663, 1162391, 159723, '<td valign="top">I think this entry might be pushing the borders of the challenge theme, but I just love this image! Can''t really put my finger one it. It think I like everything. The colours, the light, the grain and the out of focus "boats" is just wonderful to look at. And your title made me giggle :) 10 from me. Best of luck</td>', 'I think this entry might be pushing the borders of the challenge theme, but I just love this image! Can''t really put my finger one it. It think I like everything. The colours, the light, the grain and the out of focus "boats" is just wonderful to look at. And your title made me giggle :) 10 from me. Best of luck', '2015-07-27 10:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
