(7395893, 1162453, 30982, '<td valign="top">So VERY glad the bunnies all survived!  Their cousin is happy to hear this news and sends his regards.  :-)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1076382" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30982/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1076382.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30982/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1076382.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30982/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1076382.jpg"/></a></td>', 'So VERY glad the bunnies all survived!  Their cousin is happy to hear this news and sends his regards.  :-) ', '2015-08-08 00:47:22.000000', NULL, 0),
